/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Verify Green's Theorem for the line integral oint_C [ \(x*y + y^2\)*dx + x^2*dy ], where C is the closed curve bounded by y = x and y = x^2.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Identify P, Q and Points of Intersection:) Tj
T*
(   P = xy + y^2, Q = x^2.) Tj
T*
(   Intersection: x = x^2 => x\(x - 1\) = 0 => x = 0 and x = 1.) Tj
T*
(   Points: O\(0, 0\) and A\(1, 1\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Evaluate the Double Integral iint_R \(dQ/dx - dP/dy\) dA:) Tj
T*
