T*
(   - dV = rho^2 * sin phi drho dphi dtheta.) Tj
T*
(   - Limits: rho in [0, a], phi in [0, pi], theta in [0, 2*pi].) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Evaluate the Triple Integral:) Tj
T*
(   iiint_V \(x^2 + y^2 + z^2\) dV = int_0^\(2*pi\) dtheta * int_0^pi sin phi dphi * int_0^a rho^2 *) Tj
T*
(   \(rho^2 drho\)) Tj
