(   4. Equating to Metabolic Consumption:) Tj
T*
(   - - iint_S J . n dS = iiint_V D * del^2 C dV = iiint_V R_rxn dV) Tj
T*
(   => iiint_V [ D * del^2 C - R_rxn ] dV = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Since this balance holds for any arbitrary sub-volume of the cell:) Tj
T*
(   D * del^2 C = R_rxn,) Tj
T*
(   which is the fundamental steady-state reaction-diffusion equation \(Poisson's equation for) Tj
T*
(   biotechnology\).) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The integral of the outward diffusive flux over the cell membrane exactly balances the total) Tj
T*
(   volumetric enzymatic reaction within the cell: iint_S \(-D * grad C\) . n dS = - iiint_V R_rxn) Tj
T*
(   dV.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

